    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald is delighted to bring this stunning four-bedroom, three-storey home, superbly positioned within an exclusive and wonderfully maintained small development of houses tucked away off Eglinton Road to the market.\nBeautifully refurbished throughout with exceptional attention to detail, this elegant home combines generous proportions with stylish contemporary finishes and excellent versatility.\nThe accommodation opens with a fine entrance hall featuring attractive part-panelled walls and an impressive contemporary kitchen/dining/living room with beautiful built in display cabinets, attractive marble fireplace with coal effect gas fire, superb flooring and acoustic panelled walls. This wonderful open-plan area flows seamlessly into what is currently arranged as a playroom, but which could equally serve as a superb additional reception room or family room. Floor to ceiling windows provide lovely natural light and access to the private patio garden from the kitchen.\nUpstairs, the first floor provides two generous double bedrooms together with a beautifully appointed family bathroom. The second floor offers two further double bedrooms, complemented by a luxurious modern shower room.\nOutside, the property benefits from a private patio garden, two designated car parking spaces and access to an attractive communal garden, providing a delightful additional outdoor space.\nNestled just off Eglinton Road being within minutes' walk of the extensive amenities of Donnybrook and Ranelagh, which include some of Dublin's premier restaurants and specialty shops, boutiques, gastro pubs etc. Also located close by are many of the city's premier primary and secondary schools. Within easy reach are an excellent selection of sports clubs such as David Lloyd (Riverview) Sports Centre, Donnybrook Tennis Club, Leinster Rugby grounds at the RDS, Herbert Park, Merrion Cricket grounds and the AVIVA Stadium.\nThis exceptional home combines style, quality and modern comfort and is ready for immediate occupation.\n\nSpecial Features\n• Stunning four-bedroom, three-storey townhouse\n• Exclusive small development built in 1978\n• Sought-after Eglinton Road location\n• Beautifully refurbished throughout\n• Exceptional attention to detail\n• Contemporary kitchen/dining/living room\n• Versatile additional reception/playroom\n• Four generous double bedrooms\n• Family bathroom and luxurious shower room\n• Part-panelled entrance hall and landings\n• Private patio garden\n• Two car parking spaces\n• EV Charger\n• Wired alarm system\n• Attractive communal garden"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hallway: - \nbright and spacious hallway with beautiful flooring, part panelled walls, ceiling coving and recessed lighting. Excellent understairs storage.\n\nGuest w.c.: - \nwith w.c. and wash hand basin, part tiled walls and tiled floor. Recessed lighting.\n\nKitchen/Dining/Living Room: - \nsuperb open plan area with a contemporary kitchen featuring built in wall and floor units, integrated 6 ring gas hob, extractor fan, oven, microwave and dishwasher. Plumbed for washing machine, attractive flooring, island with additional storage and sink unit. Floor to ceiling windows and door leading to the pretty private patio garden.\n\nPlayroom/Dining Room: - \nsuperb bright and spacious room with ceiling coving and recessed lighting.\n\nUPSTAIRS - \n\n\nLanding: - \nBright and spacious landing with part panelled walls, ceiling coving and recessed lighting.\n\nBedroom 1: - \nsuperb double bedroom with an excellent range of built in wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 2: - \nsuperb double bedroom.\n\nFamily Bathroom: - \nbath and shower with rain forest shower head, w.c. and wash hand basin with overhead mirrored storage presses, heated towel rail, fully tiled walls and floor. Recessed lighting.\n\nSecond Floor - \n\n\nLanding: - \nSpacious landing with part panelled walls.\n\nBedroom 3: - \nsuperb spacious double bedroom with floor to ceiling built in wardrobes. Ceiling coving.\n\nBedroom 4: - \nsuperb double bedroom with built in wardrobes and dressing table.\n\nShower Room: - \nspacious shower room , shower cubicle with rain forest shower head, wc, his & hers sinks with overhead mirrored storage presses, heated towel rail, fully tiled walls and floor, recessed lighting.\n\n"
      },
